2. Connects to SQLite database "test_db.sqlite"
3. Performs INNER JOIN to get employees with valid departments
4. Performs LEFT JOIN to include all employees (even those without valid departments)
5. Performs RIGHT JOIN to include all departments (even those without employees)
6. Performs FULL JOIN to include all employees and departments
7. Returns a JoinAnalysis struct with all four join results

